) <b>PF024</b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"color:#1F497D\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1F497D\">Kind regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1F497D\">Mandy White</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1F497D\">&nbsp;</span></p><div><div style=\"border:none; border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt; padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"\"> ACVV Futura &lt;<a href=\"mailto:acvv@futurasa.co.za\">acvv@futurasa.co.za</a>&gt; <br><b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, 10 March 2026 11:26<br><b>To:</b> <a href=\"mailto:acvvdegrendel@acvv.org.za\">acvvdegrendel@acvv.org.za</a><br><b>Subject:</b> PF024 : Mechelle Wright (73669261 ) = 31/03/2026 Retirement - Consent Form</span></p></div></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Good day</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">We have received the documents for <b>Mechelle Wright&nbsp; (73669261 ) with a retirement date 31/03/2026 from PF024</b>.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please note that i am unable to confirm the amount that will be paid out.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"614\" height=\"98\" id=\"Picture_x0020_1\" src=\"cid:image002.jpg@01DCB2BA.DB93F400\" style=\"width:6.4in; height:1.0166in\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">There are <b>two compulsory forms</b> that must be completed and signed:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\" style=\"margin-top:0cm\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Withdrawal and Retirement Claim Form</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"> must be <b>fully completed by HR and signed, and member needs to sign</b>. (<span style=\"background:lime\">Attached – RECEIVED – THANK YOU</span>), and</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Max Cash Retirement Consent Form (<span style=\"background:aqua\">Attach) (to be signed by the member</span>)</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">&#128313;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">The member must ensure that all personal information (address, contact number, tax number, and bank details) is accurate. If any information is incorrect, please make corrections directly on the form. No claims will be submitted with outstanding information.</span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Hlk216192233\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; background:aqua\">Please note that, as a retirement claim, you are entitled to take <b>100% of your benefit in cash</b> when retiring from your employer. If you <b>do not wish to take the full amount in cash</b> (e.g. you plan to purchase an annuity or preserve your benefit for a later date), please notify us as soon as possible</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; background:aqua\">.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Required Supporting Documents:</span></u></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Hlk221027167\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">(Please attached the required documents with the Consent Form</span></b></a><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">*Bank Statement (in members own name)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">*Identification Document</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">*SARS letter (Notice of Registration) which provides the member’s full names and surname , ID number , and tax number)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Hlk216961802\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">All documents MUST be returned to </span></a><a href=\"mailto:acvv@futurasa.co.za\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">acvv@futurasa.co.za</span></a><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp; for electronic submission of all claims.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">No claims will be accepted if the claim is submitted by a member or advisor directly to Sanlam.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"_Hlk214455321\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Please note that any fund with missing information, including outstanding claim forms, is recorded as <b>non-compliant</b> in the FSCA’s records.</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Your <b>urgent attention</b> to this matter is required to ensure that the fund remains compliant with regulatory requirements.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif\">Regards</span></p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:#63BE60\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:#63BE60\">Jesica Haynes</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; font-family:&quot;Century Gothic&quot;,sans-serif; color:black\">Reconciliations Specialist</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"FR\" 